OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fthis evening, one or two showers along
OL,7,Fthe Argyll coast. Then staying mainly
OL,8,Fdry overnight but still with a few
OL,9,Fshowers along the west coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FRain will spread east in the
OL,12,Fmorning. Drier weather with a few
OL,13,Fshowers spreading from the west in the
OL,14,Fafternoon. Fresh southerly winds in
OL,15,Fthe morning.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry with
OL,18,Fsunny spells on Friday, a few showers
OL,19,Fat first across Argyll. Windy with
OL,20,Frain spreading east on Saturday. Drier
OL,21,Fwith just a few showers on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
